---
{
  title: "containerp"
}
---
### NAME

    containerp() - Determine if an object inherits `STD_CONTAINER`.

### SYNOPSIS

    int containerp( object ob );

### DESCRIPTION

    Determine if an object inherits `STD_CONTAINER`.

### PARAMETERS

    ob  (object)
        THe object to test.

### RETURN VALUES

    (ob is STD_CONTAINER) 1 if the object inherits `STD_CONTAINER`.
